    "Loki-only default host/profile/workspace/AI-peer and local configuration roots; no global ~/.honcho fallback",
    "Provider backup does not include another application shared configuration",
    "Explicit owned OAuth client required before socket/browser/network; API-key setup default; context-bound OAuth helper threads",
    "Own plugin distribution/version and authored Loki commands; internal module/API/provider identifiers retained",
    "Previously silent broad-exception fallbacks log sanitized tracebacks with exception class and call stack; provider messages omitted",
    "Original license and complete runtime/dependency declarations retained; original README preserved separately",
    "Enabled injection audit defaults to the active Loki home logs directory; explicit destinations retained",
    "Profile rename freezes resolved implicit workspace/AI-peer identity and never probes global Honcho configuration",
    "Mechanical lint compliance: equivalent modern annotations, dead-noqa removal, explicit subprocess check=False and missing-timestamp sorting without naive datetime sentinel; public exported imports retained",
    "Fallback session/assistant IDs use Loki; explicit existing strings stay unchanged",
    "Wizard Enter defaults and enabled injection audit use active Loki profile; explicit configuration paths and destinations retained",
    "Retained one-time auth/peer error notice behavior while log diagnostics omit raw exception payloads",
    "Missing SDK repair uses the supported consented PM environment sync and safe generation adoption, replacing the retired dependency installer stub"
